WEBVTT

00:08:58.415 --> 00:09:04.557
a certain, "Be willing to suffer, one;
two, following your passion,

00:09:04.581 --> 00:09:08.805
and then somehow, turn that
into this creative outburst."

00:09:08.829 --> 00:09:14.781
EG: Well, I mean, I rail a lot
against passion,

00:09:14.805 --> 00:09:18.611
because I feel like passion can be
very exclusionary and very elitist,

00:09:18.635 --> 00:09:22.116
and it can leave a lot of people
feeling like they don't belong

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:23.461
in creative journeys,

00:09:23.485 --> 00:09:25.715
and they don't belong
in creative explorations.

00:09:25.739 --> 00:09:28.822
I'm much more interested
in allowing people to follow curiosity,

00:09:28.846 --> 00:09:30.726
which is a far more gentle impulse,